  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Design Sprint Wall Kit"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStage",
      "text": "01 FRAME"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitPrompt",
      "text": "Name one moment worth improving"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitContext",
      "text": "A clearer first visit"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitQuestion",
      "text": "How might we help a first-time visitor find where to start a tool loan?"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitAction",
      "text": "Read the evidence slips. Separate what was observed from what you think it means. Keep the limits…"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "Doorway to check-in desk. Loan policy, eligibility and opening hours are outside this workshop."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitMeta",
      "text": "LIB-01 | Mara Bell | 2026-10-12"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitLink",
      "text": "Evidence slips — page 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStatus",
      "text": "Fictional workshop example — no research or test performed"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitFolio",
      "text": "1 / 7"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStage",
      "text": "02 COMPARE"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitPrompt",
      "text": "Use the same criteria for both ideas"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitContext",
      "text": "A clearer first visit"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitAction",
      "text": "A Doorway sign — A sign names the check-in desk and invites questions."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitAction",
      "text": "B Welcome prompt — A volunteer gives a short welcome and names the check-in desk."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitAction",
      "text": "Work independently first. Compare both ideas against all three criteria, then discuss evidence and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "A proposal is not a measured result. Keep unknowns explicit; do not invent votes or a winner."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitMeta",
      "text": "In the room: 15 minutes. Asynchronously: use round 2 on page 7."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitLink",
      "text": "Comparison canvas — page 5"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStatus",
      "text": "Fictional workshop example — no research or test performed"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitFolio",
      "text": "2 / 7"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStage",
      "text": "03 PLAN A TEST"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitPrompt",
      "text": "Choose what you need to learn next"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitContext",
      "text": "A clearer first visit"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitQuestion",
      "text": "Can colleagues identify the check-in desk from each paper concept?"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitAction",
      "text": "Name an owner, a procedure and a decision criterion. Include an inconclusive outcome and a reason to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "Keep results unrecorded until the test happens. A small draft check does not establish broad…"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitMeta",
      "text": "In the room: 10 minutes. Asynchronously: use round 3 on page 7."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitLink",
      "text": "Test plan — page 6"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStatus",
      "text": "Fictional workshop example — no research or test performed"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitFolio",
      "text": "3 / 7"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Evidence slips"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "One record per slip. Keep the observation, interpretation and limit separate."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "E01 Imagined arrival notes"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitMeta",
      "text": "2026-10-05 | Count: 4 of 6"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitTestBody",
      "text": "Observation: Four of six first-time arrivals paused at the entrance for more than ten seconds; two went…"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitTestBody",
      "text": "Interpretation: The first action may be unclear."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitTestBody",
      "text": "Limit: One invented busy interval cannot establish the cause or represent all visitors."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitCut",
      "text": "Cut guide between evidence records"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "E02 Imagined volunteer notes"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitMeta",
      "text": "2026-10-06 | Count: 3 of 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitTestBody",
      "text": "Observation: Three of four volunteers reported repeating directions to the desk; one preferred giving a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitTestBody",
      "text": "Interpretation: A visible first step may help; personal help should remain available."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitTestBody",
      "text": "Limit: Invented staff reports are not timed visitor observations or evidence of visitor preference."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "Cut on the guide if useful. Write additional notes on the reverse; retain the evidence ID."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitLink",
      "text": "Return to Frame — page 1"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStatus",
      "text": "Fictional workshop example — no research or test performed"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitFolio",
      "text": "4 / 7"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Comparison canvas"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "Both ideas use the same criteria. Cells contain hypotheses and questions, not measured performance."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "Keep differing views and missing evidence visible. Agreement about a next test is not proof that either…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Discussion notes and unresolved objections"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitLink",
      "text": "Prepare the test plan — page 6"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitLink",
      "text": "Return to Frame — page 1"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStatus",
      "text": "Fictional workshop example — no research or test performed"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitFolio",
      "text": "5 / 7"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Plan the next test"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "A proposed check with a decision rule. Put longer procedure notes on the reverse and retain the test ID."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitMeta",
      "text": "T01 | Mara Bell | Planned 2026-10-19"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitMeta",
      "text": "Criteria: C01 | Evidence: E01"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "Result: not recorded. No test outcome is implied."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitLink",
      "text": "Choose the facilitation route — page 7"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitLink",
      "text": "Return to Frame — page 1"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStatus",
      "text": "Fictional workshop example — no research or test performed"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitFolio",
      "text": "6 / 7"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Run the workshop"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "Choose the room route or the asynchronous route. Both produce the same evidence, comparison and test…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "In the room — 45 minutes"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitTestBody",
      "text": "Orient 5 min; Frame 10 min; Compare 15 min; Plan a test 10 min; Confirm owners 5 min. Collect the two…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Asynchronously — three rounds"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "Facilitator-selected workshop folder; one response file per contributor."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitMeta",
      "text": "All deadlines: America/Phoenix."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "List missing responses. A deadline does not turn silence into agreement."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitNote",
      "text": "Offer a close-reading copy and the text equivalent. Accept written or spoken contributions; confirm the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitMeta",
      "text": "Facilitator: Mara Bell. Audience: Four tool-library volunteers."
    },
    {
      "style": "KitLink",
      "text": "Return to Frame — page 1"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitStatus",
      "text": "Fictional workshop example — no research or test performed"
    },
    {
      "style": "KitFolio",
      "text": "7 / 7"
    }
